    "words": [
      "strategy-n",
      "plan-n",
      "tactic-n"
    ],
    "note": "A **plan** is any set of things you decide to do (*plans for the weekend*). A **strategy** is a careful plan for a large or long-term goal (*a strategy for growing the business*). A **tactic** is one action or method used to reach a goal, often in the short term, and is often plural (*sales tactics*): a strategy is usually carried out through several tactics."
